opusdec: Opus decoder

This crate is a Rust port of the decoder side of libopus (float build:
celt/, silk/ fixed-point decoder core, src/opus_decoder.c, src/opus.c packet
parsing), taken from the official libopus repository
(https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/opus, mirror github.com/xiph/opus) at commit
316c675fa1c9982d76e9cdcba7231076f75047da, checkout kept at
D:\xbox-pc-port\emulator\third_party\opus.

